OL,3,GNEWSABlock of flats 'a biohazard' due
OL,4,Ato sewage - resident
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents at a block of flats have said
OL,7,Fthey are "frustrated and angry" after
OL,8,Fstruggling with broken lifts, sewage
OL,9,Fand uneven paving.
OL,11,FPeople living at Iron House in Slough,
OL,12,FBerkshire, have been complaining about
OL,13,Fsimilar issues for more than eighteen
OL,14,Fmonths.
OL,16,FAhsan Muntaz said he believed the
OL,17,Fleaking sewage, which is present on the
OL,18,Ffloor of the basement car park, was a
OL,19,F"clear health and safety issue".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
