OL,3,GNEWSABlock of flats 'a biohazard' due
OL,4,Ato sewage - resident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Centrick, which
OL,7,Fmanages the building, said: "We
OL,8,Frecognise the frustration residents at
OL,9,FThe Metalworks have experienced due to
OL,10,Fongoing drainage and lift issues, and
OL,11,Fwe apologise for the impact this has
OL,12,Fhad."
